{# ── Why it matters — white ───────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="bg-white py-12">
  <p class="text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold font-montserrat text-sm">Why it matters</p>
  <h2 class="font-montserrat font-extrabold text-2xl text-primary mt-2 leading-tight">The club can't run without you</h2>
  <p class="mt-4 text-primary/70 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-inter">As a registered non-profit, Cannock Phoenix has no paid staff. Every gala that runs, every session that happens, every swimmer that progresses is made possible by the volunteers who give their time. Many of our most committed volunteers are parents who started by simply helping at their child's first gala — and never looked back!</p>

