  <p class="mt-3 text-primary/60 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed font-inter">Whether you can commit to a regular role or just want to help out occasionally, there's a place for you at Cannock Phoenix. No experience is necessary for most roles — just enthusiasm and a willingness to help.</p>

