{# ── Officials pathway — white ─────────────────────────────── #}
<section class="bg-white py-12">
  <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-start">
    <div>
      <p class="text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold font-montserrat text-sm">Officials programme</p>
      <h2 class="font-montserrat font-extrabold text-2xl text-primary mt-2 leading-tight">Become a qualified official</h2>
      <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-[#f5f8fc] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 border border-gray-100">
        <img
          src="https://d1s9j44aio5gjs.cloudfront.net/2017/02/Swim_England_500x159px.gif"
          alt="Swim England"
          class="h-7 w-auto"
          loading="lazy">
        <span class="text-primary/55 text-xs leading-tight font-inter">Training delivered in partnership<br>with Swim England</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-primary/70 text-sm leading-relaxed font-inter">Swim England runs a structured officials pathway that takes you from Club Helper all the way through to Judge, Referee and beyond. You can progress at your own pace, and every level adds real value to the club and to competitive swimming in the region.</p>
      <p class="mt-3 text-primary/70 text-sm leading-relaxed font-inter">Training is free and typically delivered online followed by practical assessment at a gala. Many of our current officials started simply by volunteering as timekeepers at their first home meet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#f5f8fc] rounded-xl px-5 py-4 border border-gray-100">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary shrink-0 mt-2"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-inter font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-primary">Club Helper</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-primary/55 text-sm font-inter">Assist with poolside duties at club galas. Starting point for all new officials.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#f5f8fc] rounded-xl px-5 py-4 border border-gray-100">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary shrink-0 mt-2"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-inter font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-primary">Timekeeper</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-primary/55 text-sm font-inter">Operate lane timing equipment. Swim England certified training course required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#f5f8fc] rounded-xl px-5 py-4 border border-gray-100">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary shrink-0 mt-2"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-inter font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-primary">Judge / Starter</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-primary/55 text-sm font-inter">Assess turns, finishes and starts under the rules of competition.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-[#f5f8fc] rounded-xl px-5 py-4 border border-gray-100">
        <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-secondary shrink-0 mt-2"></div>
        <div>
          <p class="font-inter font-semibold text-[0.9rem] text-primary">Referee</p>
          <p class="mt-0.5 text-primary/55 text-sm font-inter">Oversee the entire competition. The most senior poolside official role.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

